# Local overrides for the Worker runtime (`pnpm dev`, `pnpm preview`).
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) only if you need one. SUPABASE_URL and
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY are public and already live in wrangler.jsonc `vars`,
# so step 1 needs nothing here. Values in .dev.vars override `vars` locally.
#
# Future secrets go here locally and into production with
# `wrangler secret put <NAME>` — never into wrangler.jsonc, never with a
# fallback in code. Example, not read by any code yet:
#
# The SECRET key bypasses RLS on a database the live mobile app shares. It
# must never reach a client island or a prerendered page.
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
